{'symbol': 'NLOK', 'date': '2022-03-16 04:00:00', 'title': 'U.K. COMPETITION AND MARKETS AUTHORITY TO REFER MERGER TO A PHASE 2 REVIEW', 'text': 'MERGER TIMELINE DELAYED TO MID-TO-LATE 2022 TEMPE, ARIZ., MARCH 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NORTONLIFELOCK (NASDAQ: NLOK), A GLOBAL LEADER IN CONSUMER CYBER SAFETY,\xa0TODAY RELEASED THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT RELATED TO THE STATUS OF THE FINAL REMAINING REGULATORY APPROVAL FOR NORTONLIFELOCK\'S RECOMMENDED MERGER (THE "MERGER") WITH AVAST PLC ("AVAST"): BASED UPON POTENTIAL IMPACT IN THE U.K. MARKET, THE CMA INTENDS TO REFER THE MERGER TO A PHASE 2 INVESTIGATION IF THE COMPANY DOES NOT OFFER PHASE 1 REMEDIES.'}